cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Shuddhi, please cite it as below."
title: "Shuddhi: open-source LLM training data provenance, dedup and PII redaction"
abstract: >-
  Shuddhi is an open-source data factory for LLM training corpora. It gates
  data by provenance, removes exact and near-duplicates, redacts PII, screens
  for benchmark contamination, and seals each build with a reproducible
  content hash. It drafts the EU AI Act Article 53(1)(d) training-content
  summary from the build manifest.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "ShepHertz Technologies"
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/agentanywhere/shuddhi"
url: "https://agentanywhere.ai/shuddhi"
keywords:
  - llm
  - training-data
  - data-provenance
  - deduplication
  - pii-redaction
  - eu-ai-act
  - indic-nlp
  - reproducibility
